            <title><![CDATA[Are We Losing Control of AI? What’s Driving New Fears]]></title>
            <description><![CDATA[For years, as artificial intelligence has evolved from the stuff of sci-fi movies to an app ordinary people have installed on their phones, tech leaders and some AI insiders have talked about the potential for it to escape human control and wreak havoc on society. Those fears have become impossible to ignore in recent days, driven by advances in the technology, a series of cybersecurity breaches involving AI agents, and new warnings from rank-and-file AI staffers.]]></description>
            <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-09-14/are-we-losing-control-of-ai-what-s-driving-new-fears</link>
            <guid isPermaLink="false">TLD6EOR24U9800</guid>
            <dc:creator><![CDATA[William Norris, Nilushi Karunaratne and Thomas Pfeiffer]]></dc:creator>
            <pubDate>Mon, 14 Sep 2026 19:35:09 GMT</pubDate>
